    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A little troll, yes - that\u2019s you, awaken to find themselves captured in a mysterious house. What is this place, and why are you here? Comb through the nooks and crannies for things to aid your escape, and unravel the story hidden within this place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811070/extras/3dcc2b7a7bc007157d9866c71828de78.poster.avif?t=1750251346\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811070/extras/3dcc2b7a7bc007157d9866c71828de78.webm?t=1750251346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811070/extras/3dcc2b7a7bc007157d9866c71828de78.mp4?t=1750251346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover secrets and clues by exploring your environment\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles through both creative and logical thinking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet interesting characters inspired by folklore tales</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully hand-drawn 2D art and animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mature themes and horror elements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811070/extras/bb64973eac2e0b6afafd89a6eede2e45.poster.avif?t=1750251346\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811070/extras/bb64973eac2e0b6afafd89a6eede2e45.webm?t=1750251346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><sou